<title>UK: ING Barings appoints corporate debt research head.</title>
<headline>ING Barings appoints corporate debt research head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings, the investment banking arm of Dutch financial giant Internationale Nederlanden Groep NV, said on Tuesday it had appointed Tariq Pasha as head of corporate debt research in London.</p>
<p>Pasha, who will be responsible for developing primary and secondary market research and the ratings advisory business for emerging markets debt issuers, joins ING Barings from NatWest Markets, the investment banking arm of Britain's National Westminster Bank Plc.</p>
<p>At NatWest Markets Pasha was head of credit research, ING Barings said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
